Proposed downstream-only control for PR #141876
Base: af16e3ab16eed2492552c325ad1777533a8b7004
Not applied or executed. The harness also supplies an equivalent, explicitly
labelled PATCHED_INSTRUMENTED_CONTROL using the actual checkout functions.

Standalone read is supported; batch read is not advertised. Ambiguous read plus
operations is rejected rather than silently dropping the requested operations.
_mutation_lock below is NEW in this proposal: it does not exist on the inspected
#141876/main heads. The existing production _file_lock remains in both paths.

